{
  "_README": [
    "Pricing for Paid Off Clothes. Edit this file to change prices — no code changes needed.",
    "Save the file and reload the site; the storefront reads it on every page load.",
    "",
    "TIERS decide which price applies at a given quantity. Each tier has a minQty, and the",
    "highest tier whose minQty the buyer reaches wins. Tiers are per CATEGORY, so shoes can use",
    "completely different quantity breaks than shirts. A single product may override both its",
    "tier ladder and its prices under 'products'.",
    "",
    "Quantity is counted per style across sizes: 3 medium + 2 large of one tee is 5 pieces.",
    "",
    "Prices are per single item at that tier — NOT a package price. If shirts are $32 each at",
    "retail and $26 each once you buy 5, then retail=32 and smallBulk=26.",
    "",
    "Every tier below is currently seeded to the product's existing price, so nothing has",
    "changed yet. Lower the bulk numbers when you're ready.",
    "",
    "Adding a category: add it under 'categories' with its own tiers. Anything not listed",
    "falls back to 'defaultTiers'. (To also show it on the site, add it to CATEGORIES in",
    "script.js — that's the storefront nav, separate from pricing.)",
    "Adding a product: add it under 'products' keyed by its exact name from script.js.",
    "A product with no entry here falls back to its category tiers and its script.js price."
  ],
